          "url": "https://github.com/honeydew-ai/honeydew-ai-coding-agents-plugins/blob/36797d906d0ae0730e9580ab59995df48431d442/CHANGELOG.md#L276-L276"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9b59f2776c21bb3b601869cc9cf576085e09512556e4e013f5f0306ff3ffeec5",
        "slc_acd24d660f20d4478afe4ca0093fb0bd5b869c12775261f03a9db4a8430ca03c"
      ],
      "text": "PreToolUse hooks gate Honeydew MCP tool calls: query, exploration, and typed create/update calls are blocked once per session when the matching skill is not loaded, with the block naming the skill to load before the retry proceeds."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2a906f7fa72b7c6c0e561a1ba549193a9d800a50f6484e37a34c037faa77bc4e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "36797d906d0ae0730e9580ab59995df48431d442",
          "git_sha": "4ce8358cf6eac3b571e844e90d20ca083b6b692e",
          "line_end": 56,
          "line_start": 55,
          "path": "CHANGELOG.md",
          "repository": "honeydew-ai/honeydew-ai-coding-agents-plugins",
          "url": "https://github.com/honeydew-ai/honeydew-ai-coding-agents-plugins/blob/36797d906d0ae0730e9580ab59995df48431d442/CHANGELOG.md#L55-L56"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9b59f2776c21bb3b601869cc9cf576085e09512556e4e013f5f0306ff3ffeec5"
      ],
      "text": "The hook gating is designed to be non-wedging: a block fires at most once per skill so a retry always goes through, and uncertain cases such as a missing skill or unparseable payload let the call proceed."
    },
    {
